\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of OpenAgency. (a) Three layers keep the collaboration protocol independent of the backend that realizes each role. (b) Under one governed protocol the agents choose their own handoffs, so different tasks instantiate different collaborations. (c) The evolving agent reads the collected trajectories and returns the next protocol, moving inside the evolving space under one of three edit strategies.}}{3}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:intro}{{1}{3}{Overview of OpenAgency. (a) Three layers keep the collaboration protocol independent of the backend that realizes each role. (b) Under one governed protocol the agents choose their own handoffs, so different tasks instantiate different collaborations. (c) The evolving agent reads the collected trajectories and returns the next protocol, moving inside the evolving space under one of three edit strategies}{figure.4}{}}
